{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And it shall be. For a terror.</b> Like יחוגו וינועו כשכור (Psalm 107:27), from the root of ובמחוגה יתארהו (Isaiah 44:13)." "The sense of <b>the land of Judah</b> is on account of the Shekhinah that dwells there."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:20.272684925Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}